{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"main関数","summary":"C/C++ プログラムの開始地点。戻り値 0 は正常終了を表します。","examples":[{"code":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n  printf(\"Hello\\n\");\n  return 0;\n}","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0001"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"#include","summary":"ヘッダファイルを取り込む前処理命令です。","examples":[{"code":"#include <iostream>","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0002"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"#define","summary":"マクロ（置き換え規則）や定数を定義する前処理命令。","examples":[{"code":"#define PI 3.14159","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0003"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"#ifdef / #ifndef","summary":"条件付きコンパイル。インクルードガードにも使います。","examples":[{"code":"#ifndef MY_H\n#define MY_H\n#endif","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0004"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"#pragma once","summary":"ヘッダの二重読み込みを防ぐ書き方（ほとんどのコンパイラで使える）。","examples":[{"code":"#pragma once","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0005"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"コメント","summary":"// は1行、/* */ は複数行。","examples":[{"code":"// メモ","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0006"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"コンパイル","summary":"ソースコードを実行ファイルに変換します。","examples":[{"code":"gcc main.c -o main\ng++ main.cpp -o main","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0007"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"リンカ","summary":"複数のオブジェクトファイルやライブラリをつなぎ、実行ファイルにします。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0008"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"基本","term":"ヘッダファイルとソースファイル","summary":"宣言を .h に、実装を .c / .cpp に分けて管理します。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0009"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"int / long / short","summary":"整数型。サイズは環境で変わります。","examples":[{"code":"int n = 10;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0010"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"float / double","summary":"小数型。double の方が精度が高い。","examples":[{"code":"double d = 3.14;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0011"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"char","summary":"1バイトの整数型で、文字を表すのに使います。","examples":[{"code":"char c = 'A';","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0012"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"unsigned","summary":"符号なし（負の数を持たない）整数型。","examples":[{"code":"unsigned int u = 5;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0013"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"sizeof","summary":"型や変数のバイト数を返します。","examples":[{"code":"sizeof(int); // 多くは 4","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0014"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"<stdint.h> 固定幅整数","summary":"サイズが決まっている整数型（int32_t, uint8_t など）。","examples":[{"code":"int32_t x = 1;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0015"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"bool（C++）","summary":"true / false を持つ型。C では <stdbool.h> が必要。","examples":[{"code":"bool ok = true;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0016"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"const","summary":"書き換え不可にする修飾子。","examples":[{"code":"const int MAX = 100;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0017"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"enum","summary":"名前付き整数定数のまとまり。C++ では enum class が安全。","examples":[{"code":"enum class Color { Red, Blue };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0018"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"struct","summary":"複数の値をひとまとめにする型。","examples":[{"code":"struct P { int x; int y; };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0019"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"union","summary":"同じメモリを複数の型で共有する型。","examples":[{"code":"union U { int i; float f; };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0020"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"typedef / using","summary":"型に別名を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"typedef unsigned int uint;\nusing uint = unsigned int;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0021"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"配列","summary":"同じ型をまとめた領域。範囲外アクセスは未定義動作になり危険です。","examples":[{"code":"int a[3] = {1, 2, 3};","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0022"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"データ型","term":"auto","summary":"初期値から型を推論します（C++11以降）。","examples":[{"code":"auto x = 3.5;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0023"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"算術演算子","summary":"+ - * / %。整数同士の割り算は小数点以下が切り捨てられます。","examples":[{"code":"7 / 2; // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0024"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"ビット演算子","summary":"& | ^ ~ << >> でビット単位の操作をします。","examples":[{"code":"flags & 0x01","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0025"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"++ / --","summary":"1増やす／減らす。前置と後置で式の値が変わります。","examples":[{"code":"i++;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0026"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"&& || !","summary":"論理積・論理和・否定。左から評価し、結果が決まれば残りを評価しません。","examples":[{"code":"if (p && p->x) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0027"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"三項演算子","summary":"条件 ? A : B。","examples":[{"code":"int m = a > b ? a : b;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0028"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"演算子","term":"キャスト","summary":"型を変換します。C++ では static_cast を使います。","examples":[{"code":"static_cast<int>(3.9)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0029"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"if / else","summary":"条件分岐。","examples":[{"code":"if (x > 0) { } else { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0030"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"switch","summary":"整数や列挙型で分岐。break が必要です。","examples":[{"code":"switch (n) { case 1: break; default: break; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0031"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"for","summary":"回数を決めた繰り返し。","examples":[{"code":"for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0032"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"範囲for（C++）","summary":"コンテナの要素を順に取り出します。","examples":[{"code":"for (auto& v : vec) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0033"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"while / do-while","summary":"条件が真の間繰り返す。","examples":[{"code":"while (n--) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0034"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"制御構文","term":"goto","summary":"指定のラベルへ飛ぶ文。多用すると読みにくくなるため、エラー処理の後始末などに限ります。","examples":[{"code":"goto end;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0035"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"関数の宣言と定義","summary":"使う前に型を知らせる宣言（プロトタイプ）と、中身を書く定義。","examples":[{"code":"int add(int a, int b);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0036"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"値渡しと参照渡し","summary":"値渡しはコピー、C++ の参照 & は元の変数をそのまま扱います。","examples":[{"code":"void inc(int& n) { n++; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0037"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"ポインタ渡し","summary":"アドレスを渡して関数内で元の値を書き換えます。","examples":[{"code":"void inc(int* p) { (*p)++; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0038"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"デフォルト引数（C++）","summary":"引数省略時の既定値。","examples":[{"code":"void f(int a = 1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0039"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"オーバーロード（C++）","summary":"同名で引数の異なる関数を複数定義。","examples":[{"code":"int f(int); double f(double);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0040"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"inline","summary":"関数呼び出しを展開する指定。小さな関数向け。","examples":[{"code":"inline int sq(int x) { return x * x; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0041"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"static（関数・変数）","summary":"そのファイル内だけで有効、または呼び出しをまたいで値を保持します。","examples":[{"code":"static int count = 0;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0042"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"ラムダ式（C++）","summary":"その場で書ける無名関数。[ ] で外側の変数を取り込みます。","examples":[{"code":"auto f = [](int a, int b) { return a + b; };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0043"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"関数ポインタ","summary":"関数のアドレスを保持する変数。コールバックに使います。","examples":[{"code":"int (*fp)(int, int) = add;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0044"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"関数","term":"可変長引数","summary":"printf のように引数の数が決まっていない関数。","examples":[{"code":"#include <stdarg.h>","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0045"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"ポインタ","summary":"メモリ上のアドレスを持つ変数。* で指す先の値を読み書きします。","examples":[{"code":"int x = 5;\nint* p = &x;\n*p = 6;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0046"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"アドレス演算子 &","summary":"変数のアドレスを取得します。","examples":[{"code":"&x","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0047"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"NULL / nullptr","summary":"どこも指していないポインタ。C++11 以降は nullptr を使います。","examples":[{"code":"int* p = nullptr;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0048"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"ポインタ演算","summary":"ポインタに整数を足すと、型の大きさ単位で進みます。","examples":[{"code":"*(a + 1) // a[1]","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0049"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"malloc / free（C）","summary":"実行時にメモリを確保／解放します。確保したら必ず解放します。","examples":[{"code":"int* p = malloc(sizeof(int) * 10);\nfree(p);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0050"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"new / delete（C++）","summary":"オブジェクトを動的に作る／破棄する。配列は new[] / delete[]。","examples":[{"code":"int* p = new int(5);\ndelete p;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0051"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"メモリリーク","summary":"確保したメモリを解放し忘れ、使えない領域が増えること。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0052"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"ダングリングポインタ","summary":"解放済みの領域を指したままのポインタ。使うと未定義動作です。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0053"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"バッファオーバーフロー","summary":"確保した範囲を超えて書き込むこと。脆弱性の原因になります。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0054"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"スタックとヒープ","summary":"自動で管理される領域（スタック）と、自分で管理する領域（ヒープ）。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0055"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"スマートポインタ（C++）","summary":"解放を自動化するポインタ。unique_ptr, shared_ptr。","examples":[{"code":"auto p = std::make_unique<int>(5);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0056"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"RAII","summary":"資源の確保を初期化、解放を破棄に結びつける C++ の設計思想。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0057"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"const とポインタ","summary":"const int* は指す先が変更不可、int* const はポインタ自体が変更不可。","examples":[{"code":"const int* p;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0058"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ポインタとメモリ","term":"memcpy / memset","summary":"メモリのコピー／指定値での埋め込み。","examples":[{"code":"memset(buf, 0, sizeof(buf));","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0059"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"char 配列と '\\\\0'","summary":"C の文字列は末尾に終端文字 '\\\\0' を持つ char 配列。","examples":[{"code":"char s[] = \"abc\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0060"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"strlen","summary":"文字列の長さ（終端を除く）。","examples":[{"code":"strlen(\"abc\"); // 3","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0061"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"strcpy / strncpy","summary":"文字列をコピーします。長さを確認しないと危険なので、strncpy や snprintf を使います。","examples":[{"code":"strncpy(dst, src, sizeof(dst) - 1);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0062"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"strcmp","summary":"文字列を比較します。同じなら 0。","examples":[{"code":"strcmp(a, b) == 0","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0063"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"strcat","summary":"文字列を連結します。","examples":[{"code":"strcat(a, b);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0064"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"snprintf","summary":"書式付きで、サイズを守って文字列を作ります。","examples":[{"code":"snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), \"%d\", n);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0065"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"文字列(C)","term":"atoi / strtol","summary":"文字列を整数に変換。strtol はエラーを検出できます。","examples":[{"code":"long n = strtol(s, NULL, 10);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0066"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"printf","summary":"書式付きの出力。%d 整数、%f 小数、%s 文字列。","examples":[{"code":"printf(\"%d %.2f %s\\n\", 1, 2.5, \"a\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0067"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"scanf","summary":"書式付きの入力。戻り値で成功数を確認します。","examples":[{"code":"scanf(\"%d\", &n);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0068"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"fopen / fclose","summary":"ファイルを開く／閉じる。","examples":[{"code":"FILE* f = fopen(\"a.txt\", \"r\");\nfclose(f);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0069"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"fgets","summary":"1行を安全に読みます。","examples":[{"code":"fgets(buf, sizeof(buf), stdin);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0070"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"fprintf / fputs","summary":"ファイルや標準エラーに出力します。","examples":[{"code":"fprintf(stderr, \"エラー\\n\");","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0071"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"入出力(C)","term":"EOF","summary":"入力の終わりを表す値。","examples":[{"code":"while ((c = getchar()) != EOF) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0072"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"C++の基本","term":"std::cout / cin","summary":"標準出力／標準入力。","examples":[{"code":"std::cout << \"Hello\" << std::endl;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0073"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"C++の基本","term":"namespace","summary":"名前の衝突を避ける区画。","examples":[{"code":"using namespace std;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0074"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"C++の基本","term":"std::string","summary":"長さを自動管理する文字列クラス。","examples":[{"code":"std::string s = \"abc\";\ns += \"d\";","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0075"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"C++の基本","term":"参照 &","summary":"別名。ポインタより安全に使えます。","examples":[{"code":"int& r = x;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0076"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"C++の基本","term":"範囲外チェック at()","summary":"vector の at() は範囲外で例外を出します。[] はチェックしません。","examples":[{"code":"v.at(10);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0077"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"class","summary":"データとメソッドをまとめた型。既定で private。","examples":[{"code":"class A { public: int x; };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0078"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"コンストラクタ","summary":"生成時の初期化。初期化子リストで効率よく書けます。","examples":[{"code":"A(int v) : x(v) { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0079"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"デストラクタ","summary":"破棄時に呼ばれる後始末。","examples":[{"code":"~A() { }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0080"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"継承","summary":"既存クラスを引き継ぎます。","examples":[{"code":"class B : public A { };","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0081"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"virtual","summary":"派生クラスで上書きできるメソッド。基底クラスのデストラクタにも付けます。","examples":[{"code":"virtual void f();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0082"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"override","summary":"基底クラスの virtual を上書きする意図を示し、間違いを検出させます。","examples":[{"code":"void f() override;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0083"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"純粋仮想関数","summary":"= 0 で実装を持たない関数。抽象クラスにします。","examples":[{"code":"virtual void f() = 0;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0084"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"コピーとムーブ","summary":"値をコピーするか、中身を移すか。ムーブで不要なコピーを避けられます。","examples":[{"code":"A(A&& other) noexcept;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0085"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"friend","summary":"private な部分への特別なアクセスを許す宣言。","examples":[{"code":"friend class B;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0086"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"演算子オーバーロード","summary":"自作の型に + などの演算を定義します。","examples":[{"code":"A operator+(const A& o) const;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0087"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"static メンバ","summary":"クラス全体で共有されるメンバ。","examples":[{"code":"static int count;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0088"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"テンプレート","summary":"型を引数にした汎用のクラス・関数。","examples":[{"code":"template <typename T>\nT mx(T a, T b) { return a > b ? a : b; }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0089"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"explicit","summary":"意図しない暗黙の型変換を禁止します。","examples":[{"code":"explicit A(int);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0090"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"クラス(C++)","term":"default / delete","summary":"コンパイラ生成の関数を使う／禁止する。","examples":[{"code":"A(const A&) = delete;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0091"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"vector","summary":"大きさを変えられる配列。","examples":[{"code":"std::vector<int> v = {1, 2};\nv.push_back(3);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0092"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"map / unordered_map","summary":"キーと値の組。map は順序つき、unordered_map はハッシュで高速。","examples":[{"code":"std::map<std::string,int> m;\nm[\"a\"] = 1;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0093"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"set / unordered_set","summary":"重複のない集合。","examples":[{"code":"std::set<int> s;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0094"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"list / deque","summary":"連結リスト／両端から出し入れできるキュー。","examples":[{"code":"std::deque<int> d;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0095"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"stack / queue","summary":"後入れ先出し／先入れ先出しの入れ物。","examples":[{"code":"std::queue<int> q;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0096"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"pair / tuple","summary":"複数の値を組にする。","examples":[{"code":"std::pair<int,int> p = {1, 2};","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0097"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"イテレータ","summary":"コンテナの要素をたどるための目印。","examples":[{"code":"for (auto it = v.begin(); it != v.end(); ++it)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0098"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::sort","summary":"範囲を並べ替えます。比較関数も渡せます。","examples":[{"code":"std::sort(v.begin(), v.end());","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0099"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::find","summary":"範囲から値を探します。","examples":[{"code":"std::find(v.begin(), v.end(), 3);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0100"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::accumulate","summary":"範囲の合計や畳み込みを計算します。","examples":[{"code":"std::accumulate(v.begin(), v.end(), 0);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0101"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::optional","summary":"値があるかないかを表します（C++17）。","examples":[{"code":"std::optional<int> o;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0102"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::variant","summary":"複数の型のうちどれか1つを保持する型（C++17）。","examples":[{"code":"std::variant<int, std::string> v;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0103"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::chrono","summary":"時間の計測や長さを表す標準ライブラリ。","examples":[{"code":"auto t = std::chrono::steady_clock::now();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0104"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::thread","summary":"スレッドを作る標準クラス。","examples":[{"code":"std::thread t([]{ work(); });\nt.join();","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0105"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"STL","term":"std::mutex","summary":"排他制御用のロック。lock_guard と併用します。","examples":[{"code":"std::lock_guard<std::mutex> g(m);","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0106"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"Makefile","summary":"ビルド手順を書く設定ファイル。","examples":[{"code":"main: main.o\n\\tgcc -o main main.o","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0107"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"CMake","summary":"ビルド設定を生成するツール。","examples":[{"code":"cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.20)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0108"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"gdb","summary":"デバッガ。ブレークポイントや変数の確認ができます。","examples":[{"code":"gdb ./main","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0109"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"Valgrind / AddressSanitizer","summary":"メモリのエラーやリークを検出するツール。","examples":[{"code":"g++ -fsanitize=address main.cpp","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0110"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"警告オプション","summary":"-Wall -Wextra で警告を増やし、バグを早く見つけます。","examples":[{"code":"gcc -Wall -Wextra main.c","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0111"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"最適化オプション","summary":"-O2 などで実行を速くします。デバッグ時は -g を付けます。","examples":[{"code":"g++ -O2 main.cpp","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0112"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ビルド","term":"未定義動作","summary":"言語の規則上、結果が保証されない動作。配列の範囲外アクセスなどで起こります。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0113"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"ゲームループ","summary":"入力・更新・描画を繰り返す、ゲームの心臓部。","examples":[{"code":"while (running) { input(); update(); draw(); }","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0114"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"フレームレート（FPS）","summary":"1秒あたりの描画回数。60FPS なら約16.6ミリ秒ごとに更新します。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0115"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"デルタタイム","summary":"前のフレームからの経過時間。動きを端末の速さに依存させないために使います。","examples":[{"code":"pos += speed * dt;","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0116"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"衝突判定","summary":"物体同士が重なったかを調べる処理。矩形、円などの方法があります。","examples":[{"code":"a.x < b.x + b.w && a.x + a.w > b.x","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0117"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"SDL / SFML","summary":"ウィンドウ、入力、音、描画をまとめて扱えるライブラリ。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0118"},{"lang":"cpp","category":"ゲーム開発","term":"Unreal Engine","summary":"C++ で拡張できる、商用ゲームでも使われるゲームエンジン。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"cpp-0119"}]}